  "nativeBefore": "Four Qt-interface cases pass; four direct-native seek/rate cases fail to cancel the same live estimator and hook objects.",
  "nativeAfter": "All eight audio/subtitle by Qt/native seek/rate cases pass with the same production Connections hooks and estimator objects alive. No delay adjustment is published. Actual time/rate, track roles and raw overrides are checked. Direct rate observers can query the unlocked player.",
  "ordinary": "Initial half-speed paused FIRST caption. Select 2x, actual Escape returns to tracks with 2x retained. Paused seek to 30s displays MIDDLE; resume and re-pause at 54s displays LAST; Next opens generated ASS media, paused around 18s displays FIRST. Normal Quit, unchanged guards, 602 modules, no diagnostics.",
  "limits": [
    "Native hook isolation does not instantiate the whole visual subpage.",
    "Ordinary modal navigation cannot by itself isolate estimator lifetime from cancellation.",
    "After assertions also check settled setup time, actual event result and an unlocked direct observer; the before/after source snapshots retain this distinction.",
    "No complete W1, W2, visual, final-package or beta acceptance."
  ]
